    "title": "Under Construction - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Antsy McClain ,\n13 hours ago When our hearts need to heal, there is nothing like family, friends and the warm summer wind. Love speaks easiest in summer. Her voice is clearer, more resonant. In summer, love doesn’t have to whisper as it does among the bare branches of January. There’s something in the warm wind — summer’s voice — as it whisks through boughs heavy with leaves and harmonizes with the birds. The trees are complicit in our summer secrets. Read full article",
